WEBVTT

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.006
What?

00:00:10.509 --> 00:00:11.509
[Sonic] Did you throw it?

00:00:12.549 --> 00:00:14.929
Oh, God.
[Sonic] What?
Tell me what "Oh, God."

00:00:15.009 --> 00:00:16.848
I mixed up the rings
when I was teasing Jojo.

00:00:17.009 --> 00:00:18.429
What?
Where is it then?

00:00:22.328 --> 00:00:23.689
You don't want to know.

00:00:23.768 --> 00:00:25.129
But I do, Tom.

00:00:25.229 --> 00:00:26.568
[sighs]
I very much want to know,

00:00:26.568 --> 00:00:28.849
before I become
a hedgehog-flavored snow cone.

00:00:29.289 --> 00:00:31.129
Hang tight, buddy.
I got this.

00:00:31.229 --> 00:00:32.949
With this ring, Rachel...

00:00:33.888 --> 00:00:34.928
Hey! Hi.
[guests gasp]

00:00:36.328 --> 00:00:37.328
Uh...
Everything okay, bud?

00:00:37.889 --> 00:00:39.109
Not really.
What are you doing?

00:00:39.129 --> 00:00:41.229
This is gonna sound crazy,
but I need to see that ring

00:00:41.229 --> 00:00:43.989
for just one second.
Have you lost your mind?

00:00:44.149 --> 00:00:45.268
I'm gonna give it
right back, I promise.

00:00:45.568 --> 00:00:48.189
Please, Randall,
it's really important.
No, bro. Go sit down.

00:00:48.327 --> 00:00:51.361
Give me the ring, please?
Randall, don't look at him,
look at me.

00:00:51.465 --> 00:00:53.085
One second.
Put the ring on my finger.

00:00:53.528 --> 00:00:54.528
No, Randall,
listen to me.

00:00:54.629 --> 00:00:56.309
Randall! Look at me.
Ring on my finger.

00:00:56.409 --> 00:00:58.729
Give me the ring!
Just one second.
Put a ring on it!

00:01:00.089 --> 00:01:01.089
Please, love? Okay?

00:01:01.548 --> 00:01:02.568
With this ring--
Yes, baby.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:03.829
I'm so sorry
about this.

00:01:03.871 --> 00:01:05.713
[grunts]
[guests exclaiming]

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:09.499
[grunts]

00:01:10.507 --> 00:01:12.071
[gasps]

00:01:14.086 --> 00:01:16.414
Snow, my God.
Oh, boy.

00:01:17.108 --> 00:01:18.498
Incoming!

00:01:18.603 --> 00:01:19.749
[guests screaming]

00:01:23.084 --> 00:01:24.648
[Sonic] Oh.

00:01:26.073 --> 00:01:29.304
[guests groaning,
chattering]

00:01:30.068 --> 00:01:31.068
Anybody hurt?

00:01:31.768 --> 00:01:33.768
Sonic!
Hawaii.

00:01:34.128 --> 00:01:35.128
Are you okay?

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:37.328
What's happening?
Are you hurt?
[groaning]

00:01:37.328 --> 00:01:39.628
No, no, I'm fine.
Okay, good.

00:01:39.628 --> 00:01:40.829
Because you're in
so much trouble!

00:01:40.989 --> 00:01:42.628
Okay, you calm down.

00:01:42.849 --> 00:01:44.209
You talk.

00:01:44.588 --> 00:01:45.648
Okay, quick version.

00:01:45.948 --> 00:01:48.488
Robotnik is back on Earth
and he's after a magic emerald.

00:01:48.591 --> 00:01:49.824
[grunts, sighs]

00:01:49.929 --> 00:01:52.528
We need to get it back
or the world is doomed.

00:01:53.389 --> 00:01:54.389
Tails!

00:01:54.408 --> 00:01:56.988
Wait! All this happened
since yesterday?

00:01:57.308 --> 00:01:58.308
Wait.
Who's Tails?

00:01:58.308 --> 00:01:59.308
Tails, can you hear me?

00:01:59.448 --> 00:02:01.488
Oh, Lord,
there are two of them now.

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:03.928
Okay, let me think.
Tails, come on, buddy.

00:02:03.989 --> 00:02:05.470
[Sonic groaning]

00:02:05.661 --> 00:02:06.661
[weapons powering up]

00:02:06.829 --> 00:02:07.829
Hey!

00:02:09.068 --> 00:02:11.809
Randall,
why do all of your friends
have weapons?

00:02:14.029 --> 00:02:17.489
You really should have
taken me up on that brunch,
Mr. and Mrs. Wachowski.

00:02:18.309 --> 00:02:19.309
Olive Garden guy?

00:02:19.389 --> 00:02:21.669
It's okay, everyone.
We're federal agents.

00:02:23.029 --> 00:02:24.889
You, too, Agent.
Go ahead.

00:02:31.329 --> 00:02:32.849
You mean to tell me

00:02:33.608 --> 00:02:36.669
that this entire wedding
was a setup?
Rachel, wait a minute.

00:02:36.829 --> 00:02:37.749
What?

00:02:37.749 --> 00:02:38.709
That's correct, ma'am.

00:02:38.709 --> 00:02:40.748
Every single aspect
of Operation Catfish

00:02:40.748 --> 00:02:42.089
was a complete fabrication.

00:02:43.729 --> 00:02:44.808
Operation Catfish?

00:02:45.328 --> 00:02:46.908
So is everyone here
an agent?

00:02:48.308 --> 00:02:49.388
Are you an agent?

00:02:50.528 --> 00:02:52.329
Son of a...

00:02:52.329 --> 00:02:55.068
Was the florist an agent?
How about the photographer?

00:02:55.929 --> 00:02:58.349
The woman who waxed my...

00:02:58.349 --> 00:02:59.528
at the spa?

00:03:01.729 --> 00:03:03.068
Is Jojo an agent?

00:03:03.328 --> 00:03:04.328
[Randall] Rachel.

00:03:04.328 --> 00:03:05.229
What?

00:03:05.229 --> 00:03:06.609
Rachel, listen to me.

00:03:06.808 --> 00:03:07.808
I'm done listening!

00:03:07.808 --> 00:03:09.288
I am done listening!

00:03:09.948 --> 00:03:12.908
I am so sorry.
I am so sorry.
[sobbing]

00:03:13.209 --> 00:03:15.209
I really am.
I am so sorry.

00:03:16.879 --> 00:03:18.419
No. Hey, no!

00:03:19.639 --> 00:03:22.419
Let him go! Hey!

00:03:23.833 --> 00:03:24.729
[grunts]

00:03:24.729 --> 00:03:26.029
Sonic, hang on.

00:03:26.156 --> 00:03:28.041
Take it easy.
It's not worth it.

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:30.140
Tom!
Ah-ah-ah.

00:03:30.268 --> 00:03:33.029
Sonic is not a threat.
He's on our side.

00:03:33.089 --> 00:03:34.569
He's an uncontrolled
extraterrestrial.

00:03:35.109 --> 00:03:37.069
And your days of aiding
and abetting him are over.

00:03:37.888 --> 00:03:39.968
Secure them in the hotel
until the chopper arrives.

00:03:40.489 --> 00:03:41.489
You're making a mistake.

00:03:42.069 --> 00:03:43.308
[Rachel]
Hold on, Major A-hole!

00:03:44.248 --> 00:03:45.788
This is still my day,

00:03:46.049 --> 00:03:49.669
and someone
is gonna explain to me
what the hell is going on here!

00:03:49.748 --> 00:03:51.149
After the events
in San Francisco,

00:03:51.368 --> 00:03:53.029
a global task force
was created,

00:03:53.029 --> 00:03:56.029
devoted to protecting
our planet from alien threats.

00:03:56.288 --> 00:03:58.808
That day,
Guardian Units of Nations
was born.

00:03:59.428 --> 00:04:01.968
G-U-N.
Seriously?
GUN, yeah.

00:04:01.968 --> 00:04:04.328
Look, what about protecting
our planet from Dr. Robotnik?

00:04:05.748 --> 00:04:06.908
Robotnik is dead.

00:04:07.069 --> 00:04:08.928
You're wrong.
He's back.

00:04:09.308 --> 00:04:11.768
And you just hauled away
the only ones
who could stop him.

00:04:14.689 --> 00:04:16.548
Sounds like Robotnik
might be back in play.

00:04:16.689 --> 00:04:18.729
If he is,
I want him found immediately.

00:04:20.308 --> 00:04:22.248
And cancel my five o'clock
at the Olive Garden.

00:04:23.309 --> 00:04:24.669
Aunt Maddie?
Yeah.

00:04:24.929 --> 00:04:26.369
Sonic and his friend
dropped this.

00:04:28.455 --> 00:04:30.929
[gadgets beeping]

00:04:33.229 --> 00:04:34.309
I have an idea.

00:04:34.649 --> 00:04:36.068
And I want to have
a word with my fiancé.

00:04:37.089 --> 00:04:38.209
And that word
is "murder."

00:04:43.779 --> 00:04:46.039
[Sonic] Hey, come on.
You can't just leave us in here.

00:04:46.299 --> 00:04:49.119
My friend is hurt!
He needs a doctor,
a vet, anyone!

00:04:49.979 --> 00:04:51.998
Tails,
you got to wake up, buddy.

00:04:52.259 --> 00:04:53.419
Please wake up.

00:04:53.523 --> 00:04:56.320
[children chattering, laughing]

00:04:59.257 --> 00:05:00.655
[police radio chatter]

00:05:00.759 --> 00:05:02.717
All clear.

00:05:06.178 --> 00:05:07.998
All right.
Game plan.

00:05:08.318 --> 00:05:10.998
I get inside the hotel
and find where they're hiding
Tom and Sonic.

00:05:11.138 --> 00:05:12.698
Okay.
Then I find Randall, right?

00:05:12.979 --> 00:05:14.459
And then I squeeze
the breath

00:05:14.459 --> 00:05:18.798
from his lying, deceitful,
perfectly manscaped body!

00:05:18.897 --> 00:05:20.839
[cackles]

00:05:20.939 --> 00:05:22.298
I'm going through
a lot right now.

00:05:22.598 --> 00:05:24.418
So let me process this
my own way, okay?

00:05:24.538 --> 00:05:25.538
Sure, sure.

00:05:26.358 --> 00:05:28.139
No judgment.
Should've brought
a journal.

00:05:28.318 --> 00:05:29.318
Okay--

00:05:29.618 --> 00:05:33.078
Okay. Is this meant
to be a weapon?
This is adorable.

00:05:33.226 --> 00:05:36.171
Pew, pew!
Take that, Randall!

00:05:36.318 --> 00:05:37.398
[imitates explosion]
Run, Randall!

00:05:37.918 --> 00:05:38.918
All right.

00:05:39.579 --> 00:05:41.219
We're about
to find out.
All right!

00:05:41.599 --> 00:05:42.599
Let's go kick some booty.
[laughs]

00:05:44.669 --> 00:05:46.441
[Maddie] Shh! Shh!

00:05:56.018 --> 00:05:57.753
Rachel! No. Rachel!

00:05:58.981 --> 00:06:00.246
In a minute.

00:06:01.259 --> 00:06:02.921
Mm-mmm! Mm.

00:06:06.029 --> 00:06:07.169
Stop right there!

00:06:07.549 --> 00:06:08.549
Get the bag.

00:06:11.235 --> 00:06:12.578
[device beeping]

00:06:13.996 --> 00:06:15.786
[screaming]

00:06:17.129 --> 00:06:18.669
He's gonna
come back down, right?

00:06:18.869 --> 00:06:19.869
I don't know.
[groans]

00:06:20.189 --> 00:06:21.189
Good luck!

00:06:24.129 --> 00:06:25.909
Look. Tom and Sonic
have to be inside.

00:06:26.609 --> 00:06:28.129
I got a fiancé
to vaporize.
Uh-huh.

00:06:28.549 --> 00:06:30.609
Watch your back,
sis.
Okay.

00:06:30.709 --> 00:06:33.388
[both grunting, growls]

00:06:33.489 --> 00:06:34.489
Randall!

00:06:38.421 --> 00:06:39.563
[grunts]

00:06:41.178 --> 00:06:42.178
We got her.

00:06:43.058 --> 00:06:44.058
Move in.

00:06:47.879 --> 00:06:48.879
Okay.

00:06:53.743 --> 00:06:55.025
[grunts]

00:06:55.124 --> 00:06:56.307
[grunts]

00:06:56.405 --> 00:06:57.655
[grunts]

00:07:04.229 --> 00:07:06.388
I did not mean to do that!

00:07:08.669 --> 00:07:09.669
Whoo!

